-- column or any personal data. fund_size_cents is US cents: the list name
-- is the currency (1A).
--
-- Production already held this list's rows from an import that was never in
-- the repository, under uids nothing here can reproduce. They are removed
-- first, with any report rows (D1 does not enforce the cascade in a batch),
-- so this list's rows become exactly the ones written below and can be
-- rebuilt from the repository. No other list's rows are deleted.
--
-- A firm already in a served list (EuroTech) is not written. A Deep Tech
-- row with the same uid is replaced: D597 (migration 413) withholds Deep
-- Tech, so without this the firm would be shown by no list.
